cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research or work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "neuro-analyzer: Quantitative pediatric MRI re-analysis pipeline"
abstract: >-
  An open-source pipeline for quantitative re-analysis of pediatric structural
  brain MRI, orchestrating established neuroimaging tools (FastSurfer, dcm2niix,
  nibabel) with AI-assisted visual analysis to produce quantitative reports for
  research and educational purposes. Not a medical device.
